#: ../../openmvcam/shields/servo-shield-old.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/servo-shield-old.rst:6
msgid "Servo Shield"
msgstr "Servo Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/servo-shield-old.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Servo Shield drives up to eight hobby servos in parallel from the OpenMV"
" Cam over I2C, using a PCA9685 servo / PWM controller."
msgstr ""
"De Servo Shield stuurt tot acht hobbyservo's parallel aan vanaf de OpenMV "
"Cam via I2C, met behulp van een PCA9685 servo- / PWM-controller."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/servo-shield-old.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Servo Shield product page "
"<https://openmv.io/products/servo-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Voor de volledige datasheet, foto's en bestelinformatie, zie de "
"`productpagina van de Servo Shield <https://openmv.io/products/servo-"
"shield>`_\\ ."

